        "prefix_token_count": 57,
        "step_number": 1,
        "text": "Step 1: Recall the definition of Fibonacci numbers: \\(F_0 = 0\\), \\(F_1 = 1\\), and for \\(n \\geq 2\\), \\(F_n = F_{n-1} + F_{n-2}\\)."
      },
      {
        "aligned_char_end": 239,
        "boundary_aligned_back": true,
        "char_end": 241,
        "char_start": 130,
        "effective_step": 2,
        "end_token_index": 101,
        "near_end": false,
        "prefix_token_count": 102,
        "step_number": 2,
        "text": "Step 2: Express the given sum in terms of Fibonacci numbers: \\(\\sum_{n=1}^\\infty \\frac{F_{n+1}}{F_n F_{n+2}}\\)."
      },
      {
        "aligned_char_end": 362,
        "boundary_aligned_back": true,
        "char_end": 364,
        "char_start": 243,
        "effective_step": 3,
        "end_token_index": 157,
        "near_end": false,
        "prefix_token_count": 158,
        "step_number": 3,
        "text": "Step 3: Use the identity \\(F_{n+2} = F_{n+1} + F_n\\) to rewrite the denominator: \\(\\frac{F_{n+1}}{F_n (F_{n+1} + F_n)}\\)."
      },
      {
        "aligned_char_end": 502,
        "boundary_aligned_back": true,
        "char_end": 504,
        "char_start": 366,
        "effective_step": 4,
        "end_token_index": 219,
        "near_end": false,
        "prefix_token_count": 220,
        "step_number": 4,
        "text": "Step 4: Decompose the fraction using partial fractions: \\(\\frac{F_{n+1}}{F_n (F_{n+1} + F_n)} = \\frac{A}{F_n} + \\frac{B}{F_{n+1} + F_n}\\)."
      },
      {
        "aligned_char_end": 639,
        "boundary_aligned_back": true,
        "char_end": 641,
        "char_start": 506,
        "effective_step": 5,
        "end_token_index": 277,
        "near_end": false,
        "prefix_token_count": 278,
        "step_number": 5,
        "text": "Step 5: Solve for \\(A\\) and \\(B\\) by equating coefficients: \\(F_{n+1} = A(F_{n+1} + F_n) + BF_n\\). This gives \\(A = 1\\) and \\(B = -1\\)."
      },
      {
        "aligned_char_end": 745,
        "boundary_aligned_back": true,
        "char_end": 747,
        "char_start": 643,
        "effective_step": 6,
        "end_token_index": 327,
        "near_end": false,
        "prefix_token_count": 328,
        "step_number": 6,
        "text": "Step 6: Rewrite the sum as \\(\\sum_{n=1}^\\infty \\left( \\frac{1}{F_n} - \\frac{1}{F_{n+1} + F_n} \\right)\\)."
      },
      {
        "aligned_char_end": 861,
        "boundary_aligned_back": true,
        "char_end": 863,
        "char_start": 749,
        "effective_step": 7,
        "end_token_index": 376,
        "near_end": false,
        "prefix_token_count": 377,
        "step_number": 7,
        "text": "Step 7: Notice that the series telescopes: \\(\\sum_{n=1}^\\infty \\left( \\frac{1}{F_n} - \\frac{1}{F_{n+1}} \\right)\\)."
      },
      {
        "aligned_char_end": 954,
